{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51619","headline":"句 · 江爲","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹影横斜水清浅，桂香浮动月黄昏。\n（《紫桃轩杂缀》）（〖1〗明李日华《紫桃轩杂缀》谓林逋名句「疎影横斜水清浅，暗香浮动月黄昏」二句爲改江爲二句而成。\n所据不详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江爲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}